    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b10f4fa8e555393915039a40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员最近推的赛马娘是谁！？\n啊，不好意思，我修正一下。\n用最近这个词感觉好像看轻了之前的推！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c332929d9556d8c90458cc763f16b31cfac7f3fe2f29fad3c9e9a985eb5e6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
