    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ded6690c682265f190749cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不是那个意思，我觉得自己对大家的爱是\n平等的，只是每个时期格外关注的对象不同。\n但这也是因为赛马娘们的光芒──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0882750e3feda84d4b6e352529706adfeac12e80ce7a68a8a7f8c4d3670ac3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
