      "uid": "zhcn:56d0730c673b7a540fbb8235",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……突如其来的问答结束后，\n爱丽数码便打开了话匣子持续讲个没完。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2220ff876a2a67e6eb8087b8a4bfd2040ca5ea7f27394cd12ff57dde6e03c1e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
