      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有机会的话我想知道你喜欢你推的哪一点！\n然后我也想跟你一起萌！！\n我想要跟人一起分享而不是自给自足！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24118708acd0520bc0ac1c2683df45bcb60b03cdbd3a89567833b915b0d4be9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
